{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_42", "source_id": "628b599e000000002103e406", "title": "痘肌爱用平价好用物", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_628b599e000000002103e406", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "正常经验内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1136, "evidence_unit_count": 32, "original_evidence_unit_count": 32, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 94, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 你們好呀 我是小森林 今天要給你們做一個不超過百元的評價毫無分享", "很細膩 那我給你們分享一個敷面膜的小技巧 就是東面膜之前都會用一個精華做搭地", "不去囤一下 那第三個就是這個洗眼奶 你們應該在我之前的視頻裡面", "還是做師傅都非常的好 它做師傅呢你可以把它分成四片 而且是完好無損的四片", "也可以在評論區按鈕給我 那我們一起等待第4期評價好用物吧 拜拜", "然後再敷上這個面膜效果加倍 那第二個呢就是我最喜歡的眼唇卸妝液", "所以我自己也收了很多盒了 他們家是CDD廠棉去貨的 就你們如果看見有貨的話"], "retained_quotes": ["然後再敷上這個面膜效果加倍 那第二個呢就是我最喜歡的眼唇卸妝液", "所以我自己也收了很多盒了 他們家是CDD廠棉去貨的 就你們如果看見有貨的話"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_628b599e000000002103e406/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_628b599e000000002103e406/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_628b599e000000002103e406/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_628b599e000000002103e406/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "03cae3fb82e0c8b7f95de36f6c83f544dd9ef19c1cbd53e9f7d7f9040a255924", "card_hash": "5c28cae6cc054e5c4a4cd6c0f04f23eff3b2433c80c3f3e813812a8960cd525a", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
